request.description:
Create an empty session. `id` is optional; Hermes generates one when omitted. `session_id` is accepted as an alias for `id`.

Example response:
```json
{
  "object": "hermes.session",
  "session": {
    "id": "sa-analysis-001",
    "source": "eksad-portal",
    "model": "system-analyst",
    "title": "Requirement Analysis"
  }
}
```

